        "Abstract": "Lexical complexity prediction (LCP) is the task of predicting the complexity of words in a text on a continuous scale. This paper presents JaLeCoN, the first Japanese LCP dataset, which provides separate complexity scores for Chinese/Korean annotators and others. The dataset includes complexity scores for single words and multi-word expressions (MWEs) and is sourced from news articles and government press conference transcripts."
